              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চিহ্ন — chihnô — \"a sign; a mark\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রাস্তার চিহ্ন দেখে চালক ধীরে চালালেন। rāstār chihnô dekhe chālôk dhīre chālālen. Seeing the road sign, the driver drove slowly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said chinho: the h is heard before the n."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চিহ্ন (chihnô) is Sanskrit cihna, \"a mark, a stamp, a sign\" (Monier-Williams), taken over whole."
            }
          ]
